# Canonical evidence files must stay BYTE-EXACT: never let git apply
# line-ending or encoding filters to audio, images or archives. The sha256 of
# these files is evidence identity (see tools/release/release-manifest.mjs).
*.wav  binary
*.flac binary
*.mp3  binary
*.ogg  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
*.zip  binary
*.exe  binary
*.dll  binary
*.vst3 binary
